{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and take object using sequence of moves. Check properties, do specific task if successful.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToArea    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
